```jsx
import { Callout } from 'nextra-theme-docs'

<Callout emoji="💡">
  This is a helpful tip!
</Callout>
```

## Code Highlighting

Nextra supports syntax highlighting for many languages:

```python
def hello_world():
    print("Hello, World!")
    return True
```

```javascript
function greet(name) {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);
    return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

## Tables

| Feature | Supported |
|---------|-----------|
| MDX | ✅ |
| Search | ✅ |
| Dark Mode | ✅ |
| Mobile | ✅ |
