## Endpoints

### GET /users

Retrieve a list of users.

**Response:**

```json
{
  "users": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "John Doe",
      "email": "john@example.com"
    }
  ]
}
```

### POST /users

Create a new user.

**Request:**

```json
{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com"
}
```
EOF

